OL,3,AThe fight to save Canadian town
OL,4,Athreatened by Trump's tariffs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs you cross the Ottawa river into
OL,7,FTemiscaming, Quebec, the paper mill
OL,8,Ftakes up much of the horizon.
OL,10,FThe town itself was built over a
OL,11,Fcentury ago, around the mill and the
OL,12,Fregion's forests filled with pine,
OL,13,Fbirch, spruce and fir. Now, the main
OL,14,Femployer and economic anchor sits idle
OL,15,Fafter trade talks broke down between
OL,16,FCanada and the US and President Donald
OL,17,FTrump imposed more tariffs on the
OL,18,Fcountry.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
