OL,3,AThe fight to save Canadian town
OL,4,Athreatened by Trump's tariffs
OL,5,
OL,6,FMost of the mill's 360 employees are
OL,7,Fout of work, kept afloat for the moment
OL,8,Fwith partial pay from government
OL,9,Ftariff-relief.
OL,11,FFor some, like Nadine Suley, the
OL,12,Fshuttering of the mill could mark not
OL,13,Fjust a lost livelihood, but a lost way
OL,14,Fof life.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
